<title>USA: Akron, Ohio won by EVEREN Securities.</title>
<headline>Akron, Ohio won by EVEREN Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEREN Securities said it won $6.310 million of Akron, Ohio, various limited tax bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.37 percent.</p>
